NOTES = {
    # ---------------- MHD Opava, trolleybuses
    '201': 'Trolleybus Kylešovice, Bílovecká – Městský hřbitov every 12 in the afternoon (Bílovecká :07 / :19 / :31 / :43 / :55), every 15 at midday; regular route under wire.',
    '202': 'Trolleybus Kateřinky – Albert hypermarket every 12 (Kateřinky :07, Albert :02 …); the Holasická short trips are off the pattern.',
    '203': 'Trolleybus Globus – Jaktař every 12 (Globus :07, Jaktař :11 …).',
    '204': 'Trolleybus Kylešovice, škola – Englišova, three trips an hour at :00, :24 and :36 (back :09, :33, :57), as every 60 with three slots. On 20 Oct it ran with replacement buses via Partyzánská (Vrchní street closure to 23 Oct), so its trolleybuses are designed: MDPO trolleybuses not in service that afternoon. It leaves the wire on Vrchní street and at Kylešovice, škola, so they are trolleybuses with an auxiliary drive: 32 Tr with traction batteries, or a 26 Tr with a diesel generator.',
    # ---------------- MHD Opava, buses
    '211': 'Praskova – Podvihov about hourly (Praskova :27, Podvihov :00); several afternoon trips are off the pattern.',
    '212': 'Divadlo – Milostovice – Vlaštovičky at irregular minutes (two buses, 160 and 408); read at Milostovice, where the short trips turn. 15:30–17:30: out of Divadlo 15:37, 16:02, 16:54, back at Milostovice 15:41, 16:33, 16:45 (Vlaštovičky 16:27, 16:39) and 17:21. Every 120 with three slots each way fits them exactly: Divadlo 15:37 / 16:02 / 16:54, Vlaštovičky 15:35 / 16:27 / 16:39 (15:35 timed to pass Milostovice at 15:41); 2 buses. No shorter interval passes the slot test (method Step 4; the earlier every 40 left 16:14, 15:47 and 17:07 without a trip). 16:54 and 15:41 are Milostovice short trips; the model bus runs them to Vlaštovičky. Off the pattern: back 17:15 (Milostovice 17:21) and the trips outside the window, whose minutes do not repeat.',
    '213': 'Kylešovice, SÚS – Vávrovice, Karlovec every 30 (:26 / :56 at both ends).',
    '215': 'Liliová – Kylešovice, škola – Globus at irregular minutes; trips that end at Kylešovice, škola count there. In 15:30–17:30 two buses ran it on 20 Oct (405 on the whole line, 403 on Liliová – Kylešovice, škola short trips): out of Liliová 15:57, 16:45, 17:16, back at Kylešovice, škola 16:20, 16:52. Every 80 with two slots each way fits them exactly (Liliová 15:57 / 16:45, Globus 16:14 / 16:46; the next slots 17:17 and 18:05 are within 2 min of 17:16 and 18:07); 2 buses. No hourly row passes (owner check: the earlier hourly :09 / :39 with 1 bus). The 15:57 and 17:17 slots stand for short trips; the model bus runs them to Globus.',
    '216': 'Dolní náměstí – Vávrovice, Držkovice, about every 30 at irregular minutes in the early afternoon. 14:00–16:00: Dolní náměstí 14:34, 14:57, 15:34, 15:54, Držkovice 14:00, 14:26, 15:01, 15:24: every 120 with four slots each way, all exact; 2 buses (every 60 at :34 / :54 and :00 / :26 also passes, one departure fewer on the minute). Routed via Vávrovice, OPAVIA (as a third of the trips run). Off the pattern: the later trips (16:42, 17:21, 18:06 …; back 16:09, 16:47 …), every 35–40 min at drifting minutes.',
    '217': 'Koupaliště – Slavkov hourly (:04 / :25) most of the day, routed once via Otice; the early-afternoon trips Divadlo – Slavkov (about every 32 min, 14:12–16:10) are off the pattern (owner check).',
    '218': 'Koupaliště – Chvalíkovice about hourly at irregular minutes; the Koupaliště – Dolní náměstí short trips are on the trunk path. 15:30–17:30: Koupaliště 15:38, 16:19, 17:10, Chvalíkovice 15:46, 16:10 (bus 407 also runs Chvalíkovice → Praskova at 16:54): every 120 with two slots each way, exact (Koupaliště 16:19 / 17:10, Chvalíkovice 15:46 / 16:10); 2 buses. Off the pattern: Koupaliště 15:38 and the trips outside the window.',
    '219': 'Malé Hoštice – Otice every 30 most of the day (Malé Hoštice :16 / :46, Otice :12 / :42), but from 16:42 the minutes move 4 min earlier, so every 30 leaves two slots each way 4 min off in 15:30–17:30. Every 120 with four slots each way copies that window exactly: Malé Hoštice 15:46, 16:16, 16:42, 17:12; Otice 15:42, 16:12, 16:42, 17:08; 2 buses. Outside it the slots are on, or 4 min from, the real every 30.',
    '220': 'Praskova – Suché Lazce, Přerovec about every 30 at uneven minutes: hourly with two slots each way, Praskova :15 / :40, Přerovec :12 / :50 (15:30–17:30 every slot within 3 min; Praskova 16:37 is 3 early, Přerovec 17:10 2 early). Off the pattern: Praskova 17:29 and the 13:20–14:20 trips at :20 / :50.',
    '222': 'Raduň – Podvihov: a few short trips (13:48 from Podvihov, 14:05 back), every 480. Raduň, Komárovská and Podvihov, Kom.Chal. have no other line.',
    '223': 'Praskova – Komárov, TEVA 2: shift trips (14:13 from TEVA 2; 5:22 and 21:27 out), every 480. It also covers TEVA 2 for 214.',
    # ---------------- Vítkovsko
    '232': 'Odry – Fulnek – Vítkov: a few trips a day, every 480 on the afternoon ones (Odry 14:37 via Hvězdová and Fulnek; Vítkov 13:30 to Fulnek). Vlkovice and Hvězdová have no other line.',
    '233': 'Vítkov – Moravice – Melč every 2 h in the afternoon: Vítkov 14:45, 16:15, 18:35; Melč 14:01, 15:02, 15:45 (the extra Melč starts are Opava buses off 240 and 247). Every 120: Vítkov 16:15, Melč 15:45, both exact. It needs 2 buses, because Melč 15:45 leaves before the Vítkov bus gets there (on 20 Oct 23-1013 and 23-2001 ran them). Owner check: the earlier every 90 with 1 bus, whose Melč slots (15:30, 17:00) have no trip. Off the pattern: Vítkov 12:00, 14:45, 18:35; Melč 13:00, 14:01, 15:02, 19:15.',
    '234': 'Vítkov – Jelenice – Březová with the Leskovec loop, every 3 h (Vítkov 14:45, Březová 15:49); timed so the bus passes Březová, škola on time. The diversion to 11 Dec (Březová, střed not served) runs.',
    '235': 'Vítkov – Klokočov loop about every 1½ h (13:05, 14:20, 16:55).',
    '236': 'Vítkov – Budišov at irregular minutes. 15:30–17:30: out of Vítkov 15:35, 16:00, 16:20, 17:25, back from Budišov 15:40, 16:50. The buses work 237 at Budišov and sleep there (the 16:20 and 17:25 buses end their day at Budišov; the morning trips start there), so 236 runs at its inbound rate: every 120, Budišov 15:40 / 16:50 and Vítkov 15:35 / 16:00, the two buses that come back (23-1007 at 16:50, 23-1008 at 17:30), all exact; 2 buses. Vítkov 16:20 and 17:25 are off the pattern (buses going home), so the Vítkov row has two slots for four departures. The Podlesí trips are 236 Podlesí (Budišov 15:20, Podlesí 13:06), every 480. Podlesí has no other line.',
    '237': 'Budišov – Staré Oldřůvky every 2 h and Budišov – Dvorce every 3 h (237 Dvorce), local school-time trips. Guntramovice has no other line.',
    '238': 'Vítkov – Jakubčovice – Odry every 70–90 min at irregular minutes, routed via Klokočůvek and Loučky, škola (as some trips run). One trip each way in 15:30–17:30 (Vítkov 16:32, Odry 16:10): every 90, both exact (Odry also 14:40 exact, 17:40 against 17:30); 2 buses. Off the pattern: Vítkov 12:57, 13:50, 14:12, 15:23, 17:55; Odry 12:20, 17:30, 18:30.',
    '678': 'Ostrava, Svinov – Bílovec – Fulnek – Vítkov about every 2 h 20 (Svinov 13:05, 15:25, 16:35, 18:55; Vítkov 14:45, 17:20, 19:39), back via Bravantice, Lidl. Every 144: Svinov 16:35, Vítkov 17:20, both exact; 2 buses (the same two departures every 120 would need 3). Off the pattern: Svinov 13:05, 15:25, 18:55 (4 min); Vítkov 14:45, 19:39 (5 min).',
    # ---------------- Opavsko
    '240': 'Opava – Hradec – Melč – Vítkov. 14:00–16:00: Opava 14:06, 14:58, Vítkov 14:32, 15:16, 15:51: every 120 with two slots each way, exact (Opava 14:06 / 14:58, Vítkov 14:32 / 15:16); 3 buses. Vítkov 15:51 is off the pattern: it is 23-1010 coming back from a 242 express run (Opava 14:45). The Melč short trips are off the pattern too. 240, 241 and 242 share their buses at Opava and Vítkov (one pool would need fewer; not applied).',
    '241': 'Opava – Štáblovice – Melč – Vítkov, back via Vítkov, Zálužné (as some trips run). 14:00–16:00: Opava 14:14, 15:04, Vítkov 14:51, 15:15, four trips by four buses of the Opava – Vítkov pool. Every 120 with two slots each way, exact; alone it needs 4 buses (owner check: every 90 with Opava 15:04 / Vítkov 15:15 only, 2 buses). The Štáblovice, Lipina trips are 241 Lipina (14:28 / 15:01), every 480. Regular route via Psychiatrická léčebna (owner check).',
    '242': 'Opava – Hradec – Březová – Vítkov. 14:30–16:30: Opava 14:35, 15:30, 16:25, Vítkov 15:33, 16:15, plus an express pair via Vítkov, Jelenice (Vítkov 14:30, Opava 14:45), listed here, not folded in (its stops are on 242 and 234). Every 120 with two slots each way, exact: Opava 14:35 / 16:25, Vítkov 15:33 / 16:15; 3 buses. Opava 15:30 is off the pattern (23-1002 goes on as 238 at Vítkov). The diversion to 11 Dec (Březová, střed not served) runs.',
    '243': 'Opava – Melč – Kružberk – Budišov: a few trips a day, every 480 (Opava 16:37, Budišov 12:10). Mokřinky and Jánské Koupele have no other line.',
    '244': 'Hradec n.Moravicí, škola – Opava: one afternoon trip (14:20), every 480, back empty. Branka u Opavy, škola has no other line.',
    '245': 'Opava – Hradec – Benkovice every 80 in the afternoon: Opava 12:48, 14:08, 15:28, Benkovice 14:35, 15:55. Every 80: Opava 14:08, Benkovice 14:35, all five exact; 1 bus. Off the pattern: Opava 18:23 (to Žimrovice). The local Benkovice – zámek trips are 245 zámek (13:15 / 13:52), every 480; the Benkovice slot of 245 also falls on 13:15.',
    '246': 'Opava – Slavkov – Dolní Životice – Litultovice – Jakartovice, Hořejší Kunčice hourly in the early afternoon (Opava :18), timed so trips that end at Dolní Životice count there. Back via the Jakartovice villages and Dolní Životice, as 17:32 runs, because the :12 slot stands for the Dolní Životice trips (13:47, 14:47); until 25 Oct 2026 the way back took the path through Hertice that skips Dolní Životice, the stop where the trips of its slot start.',
    '247': 'Opava – Stěbořice – Litultovice – Moravice: a few trips a day, every 480 on the afternoon pair (Opava 15:00, Moravice 17:00). Jezdkovice, restaurace has no other line.',
    '248': 'Opava – Stěbořice – Hlavnice – Svobodné Heřmanice hourly with gaps (Opava 13:53, 14:53, 16:53, 18:43; Heřmanice 14:45, 15:45, 17:55). Kept hourly (Opava :53, Heřmanice :45), approximate: Heřmanice 13:45 and 16:45 and Opava 15:53 have no trip (a narrow window must not halve an hourly line). Owner check: every 120 (Opava 13:53 / 15:53, Heřmanice 14:45 / 16:45) passes the slot test with 1 bus instead of 2, but runs every second hour.',
    '249': 'Opava – Jaktař – Velké Heraltice every 2 h at irregular minutes. 13:30–15:30: Opava 15:02, Velké Heraltice 14:07: every 120, both exact; 1 bus. Off the pattern: Opava 16:33, 18:43; Velké Heraltice 12:55, 15:50, 17:12. The Velké Heraltice škola – Tábor shuttle is 249 Tábor (13:28 / 13:35), every 480.',
    '250': 'Opava – Holasovice – Brumovice, Úblo and Opava – Krnov, each every 480 on their afternoon trips (Úblo 15:40 / 16:27; Krnov 16:32 / 18:25); 250 Holasovice (14:53 / 15:38) serves Holasovice, mateřská škola and Štemplovec, Charita.',
    '251': 'Opava – Velké Hoštice – Chlebičov hourly (Opava :35, Chlebičov :05; 7 of 9 and 7 of 10 departures exact over the day). The 15:35 runs at 15:05 instead (22-1008), so the 15:35 slot has no trip and the slot test fails out of Opava: kept hourly, approximate (a narrow window must not halve an hourly line). Every 120 (Opava 16:35, Chlebičov 17:05) would pass, with the same 1 bus. Off the pattern: Opava 12:30, 15:05; Chlebičov 12:55.',
    '252': 'Opava – Kravaře – Štěpánkovice – Kobeřice, hourly at Opava :25 / Kobeřice :45 outside the peak; out via Štěpánkovice, Albertovec (as one trip runs). 13:40–15:40: Opava 14:20, 14:50, Kobeřice 13:45, 14:45: every 120 with two slots each way, exact (the Kobeřice entry is every 60 at :45); 3 buses (owner check: the earlier hourly :25 / :45 with 2). The Opava – Štěpánkovice short trips are on the line. At Kobeřice the 252 buses go on as 255 and come back from it (not paired; pooling not applied). Off the pattern: Opava 12:45, 15:45, 16:25, 17:25, 18:25.',
    '253': 'Opava – Oldřišov – Hněvošice – Kobeřice hourly (Opava :30, Kobeřice :20); the Služovice, Vrbka trips every 2 h are 253 Vrbka. Regular route via Služovice, obecní úřad (the diversion ends 31 Oct).',
    '254': 'Opava – Kravaře – Bolatice – Chuchelná, out 12:48, 14:38, 15:18, 16:28, 18:38, back 14:30, 16:30, 17:30. No pattern passes both ways (14:30–16:30 holds three out and one back; the 16:30 sits on the window end): approximate, every 90 with Opava 16:28 and Chuchelná 14:30 / 17:30 exact (16:28 → 17:30 is one bus, 22-1040); the 14:58 and 16:00 slots have no trip. Off the pattern: Opava 14:38 (22-0001 goes on as 292 at Chuchelná), 15:18, 12:48, 18:38; Chuchelná 16:30; the Bolatice short trips.',
    '255': 'Kobeřice – Třebom – Chuchelná every 2 h (Kobeřice 15:09, Chuchelná 14:18).',
    '257': 'Suché Lazce – Nové Sedlice – Štítina – Kravaře: a few trips, every 480 on the afternoon pair (15:30 / 15:00). Nové Sedlice and Kravaře, Dvořisko have no other line.',
    '259': 'Jakartovice, Hořejší Kunčice – Litultovice: local school trips, every 480 on 14:42, back empty. Litultovice, kostel and Mladecko, škola have no other line.',
    '260': 'Opava – Velké Heraltice – Horní Benešov – Bruntál every 4 h, timed so the bus passes Horní Benešov on time; the Velké Heraltice – Svobodné Heřmanice trips via Košetice, náves are 260 Heřmanice (14:32 / 14:48), every 480. The Horní Benešov – Velké Heraltice short trips are off the pattern.',
    '261': 'Opava – Hradec – Březová – Fulnek – Nový Jičín every 2 h (Opava 14:22, Nový Jičín 14:35), out via Hladké Životice and back via Březová, Gručovice (as some trips run).',
    '262': 'Opava – Hradec – Skřipov – Bílovec, out via Slatina. 13:50–15:50: Opava 14:15, 14:43, Bílovec 14:45, 15:45: every 120 with two slots each way, exact (the Bílovec entry is every 60 at :45); 3 buses (owner check: every 80 with Opava 14:43 / Bílovec 14:45 only, 2). The Skřipov, Hrabství trips are 262 Skřipov (15:42 via Otice, Rybníčky), every 480. Regular route via Psychiatrická léčebna (owner check).',
    '263': 'Opava – Hrabyně – Pustá Polom – Těškovice; trips that end at Pustá Polom count there. 15:30–17:30: Opava 15:31, 16:59, back at Pustá Polom 16:12. The buses sleep at Pustá Polom (the morning trips start there; 16:59 is 22-1008 going home), so 263 runs at its inbound rate: every 120, Opava 15:31 and Těškovice 15:58 (passing Pustá Polom 16:12), exact; 2 buses. Off the pattern: Opava 16:59, 18:38, 19:46; Těškovice 17:40.',
    '264': 'Opava – Hlubočec – Pustá Polom – Těškovice. 15:30–17:30: Opava 16:44, Těškovice 16:03, run by two buses (22-0106, 22-1011): every 120, both exact; it needs 2 buses because Těškovice 16:03 leaves before the Opava bus gets there (owner check: the earlier 1-bus row, Opava 16:21 / Těškovice 17:29). Off the pattern: Opava 14:21, 15:01.',
    '267': 'Opava – Litultovice – Moravice – Nové Lublice: two trips a day each way, every 480 (back 18:02 via Jezdkovice, rozcestí, which has no other line).',
    '270': 'Opava – Mokré Lazce – Hrabyně – Ostrava, Svinov at irregular minutes (about every 80–90). 15:30–17:30: Opava 16:19, Svinov 16:26: every 80, both exact (Svinov also 17:46 against 17:45); 2 buses. Off the pattern: Opava 12:59, 15:19; Svinov 13:21, 14:21.',
    '920': 'Ostrava, Svinov – Opava – Bruntál – Rýmařov – Šumperk: hourly at :17 from Svinov, alternately to Šumperk (920, even hours) and Rýmařov (920 Rýmařov, odd hours), each every 120. 920 Opava (Opava 13:24 → Rýmařov via Jamartice, 15:02 back) serves Holasovice, Kamenec, rozcestí and Bruntál, nemocnice.',
    '923': 'Opava – Dvorce – Šternberk – Olomouc: two trips each way a day, every 480 (Opava 14:23, Olomouc 18:00).',
    # ---------------- Hlučínsko
    '075': 'Hlučín, sídliště OKD – Ostrava, Poruba, Studentská every 20 (Hlučín :12 / :32 / :52, Poruba :19 / :39 / :59). Extra trips at :02 / :22 until 14:02 (same path) made 13:40–15:40 the busiest stretch, so the model hour is set to 16:00 by hand (as 282), where every 20 is exact both ways; 4 buses. The extras are off the pattern.',
    '281': 'Třebom – Kobeřice – Hlučín – Ostrava, Přívoz, read at Kobeřice, where the Třebom, Strahovice and Kobeřice trips split. Out of Ostrava exactly every 30 at :18 / :48 (14:18–15:48); back hourly, at Kobeřice 14:11, 15:16, 16:11 (slot :13, within 3 min; Třebom :58). The buses sleep at Třebom and Strahovice, so half the afternoon departures do not come back (live map, 20 Oct): 281 runs at the inbound rate, hourly, :18 out and Třebom :58 back, three buses. The :48 departures (14:48, 15:48) take buses home and are off the pattern, as are the Hlučín – Bolatice shuttles.',
    '282': 'Píšť – Bohuslavice – Hlučín – Ostrava. Píšť leaves exactly every 2 h at :55 (13:55–21:55; 15:55 runs to Ostrava, the later ones end at Hlučín), Ostrava 14:53 and 16:54: every 120 both ways, one bus. Modelled at 16:00 (set by hand): its busiest stretch, 13:00–15:00, is the Hlučín – Závada shuttles, whose stops are on this line. Off the pattern: Ostrava 14:18 and the Hlučín → Píšť trips at 16:10 and 18:10. Bohuslavice has no other line.',
    '284': 'Hlučín – Kravaře – Štěpánkovice. Out of Hlučín 14:45, 15:15, 16:15, 17:28, 19:05; back only 16:24 all afternoon: the other buses go on from Štěpánkovice to other lines or end there (24-1116 to 283, 2TD2679, 24-1008). 284 runs at its inbound rate: every 120, Štěpánkovice 16:24 and Hlučín 17:28, exact, 1 bus (with 16:15 instead of 17:28 it needs 2). Off the pattern: Hlučín 14:45, 15:15, 16:15, 19:05. Regular route via Dolní Benešov, Zábřeh, Mexiko (diversion 16–21 Oct).',
    '285': 'Ostrava, Poruba – Děhylov – Dobroslavice – Štítina. The Štítina trips run 13:03–15:50 only, about hourly by two buses (24-1112, 22-0005): Poruba 13:09, 14:09, 15:09; Štítina 13:03, 13:48, 14:53, 15:50. Timed in their own afternoon (window 13:00–15:00): every 120, Poruba 13:09 / 14:09 (hourly at :09), Štítina 13:48 / 14:53, exact; 2 buses. The Poruba – Dobroslavice short trips (hourly :09 / :41 at midday, 16:49 / 17:01) and the Háj and Mokré Lazce trips are no longer a line of their own: all their stops are on 285 (method Step 8), and the old 285 Dobroslavice line counted the 285 trips past Dobroslavice. Off the pattern: Štítina 13:03.',
    '290': 'Hať – Hlučín – Ostrava, Přívoz. 14:40–16:40: out of Ostrava 14:44, 14:59, 15:24, 15:49, 16:19, back from Hať 14:47, 15:31, 16:07, 16:37. No single interval fits (every 40 leaves two of the five Ostrava departures out and its 15:39 slot empty), so 290 runs every 120 with four slots each way, exact; the plates pair 14:44 → 15:31, 15:24 → 16:07 and 15:49 → 16:37. The fifth departure, 16:19 (and 14:19 before the window), takes a bus home to the Hať garage and is off the pattern; with 16:19 off rather than 14:59, the four slots need four buses, not five. The owner chose this over every 40 (3 buses, three of the five Ostrava departures), 25 Oct 2026.',
    '292': 'Ostrava, Přívoz – Hlučín – Vřesina – Píšť – Bělá – Chuchelná, železniční stanice / Strahovice, kaple. Past Bělá the line forks: out of Ostrava 13:53 Chuchelná, 14:33 Strahovice, 14:58 Chuchelná, 15:33 Chuchelná, 15:53 Strahovice, 17:04 Chuchelná, 18:49 Strahovice; far fewer come back (from Chuchelná 14:21, from Strahovice 16:43 and 18:53, from Píšť, kostel 13:18 and 15:53), because the buses sleep at Strahovice, Chuchelná and Píšť. One Simutrans line per destination (Step 5), each every 160, so together they run at the inbound rate (every 80 at Hlučín): 292 to Chuchelná, Ostrava 15:33 and Chuchelná 14:21, both exact (one bus, 24-1007, runs both in reality); 292 Strahovice, Ostrava 14:33 exact, via Chuchelná, železniční stanice as that trip runs, and back from Strahovice at 15:36, timed so the bus passes Hlučín at 16:19 and 13:39 for the Píšť trips 15:53 and 13:18 (within 3 min; Strahovice has no trip to Ostrava between 6:03 and 16:43). Off the pattern, by the plates: 14:58 (83-1052 stays at Chuchelná), 15:53 (24-1009 stays at Strahovice), 13:53 (24-1116 goes on as 293), and 17:04 → 18:53 and 16:43, rounds Ostrava – Chuchelná – Strahovice – Ostrava (24-1108, 24-1007); the Hlučín – Vřesina / Píšť short trips and the Chuchelná – Strahovice / Bělá shuttles, whose stops are on the two 292 lines. Simpler alternative: one line every 80 through both ends, Ostrava → Chuchelná, železniční stanice → Strahovice → Ostrava (the 14:33 path), the same 2 buses, both stops every 80. Until 25 Oct 2026 (v8) 292 was one line to Chuchelná that read every trip at Píšť, Mýto, so both its Ostrava slots were Strahovice trips (owner: "half of the services going to Chuchelná, half going to Strahovice, kaple - but you model as one line?").',
    '293': 'Hlučín – Šilheřovice – Bohumín about every 95 min in the afternoon (Hlučín 13:55, 15:10, 17:05; Bohumín 15:02, 16:22, 18:17). Every 96: Hlučín 17:05, Bohumín 16:22, exact; 1 bus (every 120 would put a Hlučín slot on 13:05, the minute 293 ŽD leaves). Off the pattern: Hlučín 15:10; Bohumín 15:02, 18:17. The shift trips to Bohumín ŽD gate III are 293 ŽD (13:05 / 14:13), every 480.',
    '555': 'Bohumín, Starý Bohumín – Ostrava, Náměstí Republiky. From 15:00 Bohumín leaves at :01 / :28 and Ostrava at :20 / :50. Two Bohumín, Nový Bohumín short trips (13:35, 14:03; stops on the line) made 13:30–15:30 the busiest stretch, so the model hour is set to 16:00 by hand (as 282): hourly with two slots each way, exact in 15:30–17:30, Bohumín :01 / :28, Ostrava :20 / :50 (that entry is every 30 at :20); 4 buses. Off the pattern: the earlier afternoon minutes (13:08, 13:41; 14:00, 14:30) and the evening.',
}
